    description: "DEEP bakeoff assessment shows hop_limit=4 is too small for aardvark-dns (190 nodes, call chain depth 7). The entire DNS handling layer is excluded from forward slices. For small codebases, increasing hop_limit would produce manageable slices. Consider: adaptive limit based on graph diameter or node count, e.g. min(graph_diameter, max_nodes/20)."  # f591
